# Purpose

This document defines the form system for Maroc Local Hub.

Forms must be simple, accessible, and optimized for desktop and mobile.

---

# Components

- Text Input
- Text Area
- Select
- Checkbox
- Radio Button
- Toggle Switch
- Date Picker
- File Upload
- Search Field

---

# Field Sizes

Small

36px

Medium

44px

Large

52px

---

# Validation

Success

Green border

Warning

Orange border

Error

Red border

Required fields

Marked with *

---

# Labels

Always visible.

Short and descriptive.

---

# Help Text

Displayed below the field.

Keep under two lines.

---

# Error Messages

Clear

Specific

Actionable

---

# Accessibility

Support keyboard navigation.

Visible focus state.

Minimum touch target: 44 × 44 px.

Compatible with screen readers.
